{"id":"vod_sn_35991","vodId":"35991","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"虫之歌","name_cn":"虫之歌","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c04a7e0c85b70723770ae1307aa9388f.jpg"},"summary":"所谓的“虫”，是一种超越了科学解释范畴而存在的邪恶生物。它们专门附身在心怀梦想的少男少女身上，令他们拥有能够使用超能力的特异功能，政府称他们为“附虫者”。当附虫者们为了完成自己的梦想而使用超能力时，便会在社会中制造出许多怪异的景象，引起市民的恐慌。　　为了应对附虫者的存在，政府设立了名为“特别保护环境事务局”的机构，该机构负责监视附虫者，以及消灭虫，而身上的虫被消灭后，附虫者则会变为“缺陷者”。讽刺的是，在机构中供职的人们，他们本身亦是附虫者。在不断地和虫战斗的过程中，他们也在一步一步地接近他们的梦想。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GW3nni85Qw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L5aS96KSKX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/S8AKbKu4si1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Yhs5gtwpSs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mAubq8Ymk71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/B21HZGV4AT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4CvAZXFRzu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KJ1kN6eyDr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pYgsZkE9hF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/RDSVtVmZ351/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DWKxfdFcWR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/n4fghGKwUg1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:28.318Z"}